/*!
\page page_strichspectra StRichSpectra

\brief \ref page_strichspectra "StRichSpectra" — per-track Cherenkov ring summary for uDST storage.

\section strichspectra_overview Overview
StRichSpectra is the per-track output object written by StRichSpectraMaker for
uDST storage. It summarises the Cherenkov ring reconstruction for one track:
the mean angle θ_C, its sigma, photon counts, reconstructed mass², and
per-species ring-distance metrics. It is accessed via
\ref page_strichpidtraits "StRichPidTraits::getRichSpectra()".

\section strichspectra_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
TObject
└── StObject
    └── StRichSpectra
\endcode

\section strichspectra_members Data Members
| Type | Name | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| Float_t | mExtrapolatedX | Extrapolated track X on RICH pad plane (cm) |
| Float_t | mExtrapolatedY | Extrapolated track Y on RICH pad plane (cm) |
| Float_t | mDx | MIP residual ΔX (cm) |
| Float_t | mDy | MIP residual ΔY (cm) |
| Float_t | mCdx | Corrected residual X (cm) |
| Float_t | mCdy | Corrected residual Y (cm) |
| Float_t | mCherenkovAngle | Mean Cherenkov angle θ_C (rad) |
| Float_t | mCherenkovAngleSigma | Sigma of θ_C distribution (rad) |
| Int_t | mNumberOfPhotons | Photons used in θ_C reconstruction |
| Float_t | mPeakAngle | Peak angle in photon distribution (rad) |
| Int_t | mPeakPhotons | Photons at peak angle |
| Int_t | mTotalPhotons | Total photon candidates on ring |
| Float_t | mMassSquared | Reconstructed mass² (GeV²/c⁴) |
| Float_t | mLineIntegralRatio | Cherenkov ring line-integral ratio |
| Float_t | mLineIntegral | Cherenkov ring line integral |
| Float_t | mAlpha | Photon-yield correction factor |
| Int_t | mFlag | Status flag word |
| Float_t | mReserved | Reserved float |
| Float_t | mDpi | Mean distance to pion ring (cm) |
| Float_t | mDk | Mean distance to kaon ring (cm) |
| Float_t | mDp | Mean distance to proton ring (cm) |
| Int_t | mNDpi | Photons used in pion mean-D |
| Int_t | mNDk | Photons used in kaon mean-D |
| Int_t | mNDp | Photons used in proton mean-D |
| Int_t | mVersion | Production version tag |

\section strichspectra_methods Key Methods
| Signature | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| float getCherenkovAngle() const | Mean Cherenkov angle (rad) |
| float getCherenkovAngleSigma() const | Sigma of Cherenkov angle (rad) |
| int getNumberOfPhotons() const | Number of photons used |
| float getMassSquared() const | Reconstructed mass² (GeV²/c⁴) |
| float getMeanDpi() const | Mean distance to pion ring (cm) |
| float getMeanDk() const | Mean distance to kaon ring (cm) |
| float getMeanDp() const | Mean distance to proton ring (cm) |
| float getExtrapolatedX() const | Track X on pad plane (cm) |
| float getExtrapolatedY() const | Track Y on pad plane (cm) |
| int getFlag() const | Status flag word |
| int getVersion() const | Production version tag |

\section strichspectra_example Usage Example
\code{.cpp}
StRichPidTraits* richPid = dynamic_cast<StRichPidTraits*>(pidVec[i]);
if (richPid) {
    StRichSpectra* s = richPid->getRichSpectra();
    if (s) {
        float theta = s->getCherenkovAngle();
        float mass2 = s->getMassSquared();
    }
}
\endcode

